1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,280
Things I never do,

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,839
and I'm ninety-four.

3
00:00:02,839 --> 00:00:04,639
I never eat standing up.

4
00:00:04,639 --> 00:00:05,280
Never.

5
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,139
You eat standing up,

6
00:00:07,139 --> 00:00:08,099
you eat like a seagull.

7
00:00:08,099 --> 00:00:09,119
You don't even taste it.

8
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:11,500
I never take the lift.

9
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,140
Eh, we don't

10
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:12,960
have a lift.

11
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,380
Doesn't count.

12
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,019
A hundred and twelve steps

13
00:00:16,019 --> 00:00:18,359
down and up, that counts.

14
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:19,160
And I never look

15
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,620
at the telephone before

16
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,339
I look at the sea.

17
00:00:22,699 --> 00:00:24,379
Julia hates this one.

18
00:00:24,379 --> 00:00:25,140
After this, amore,

19
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,100
you put it down.

20
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,219
Part two next week.

